    "L007: \"Column conforming to KeyValueFormat attribute MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"[*FOCUS dataset column*](#glossary:FOCUS-dataset-column) MUST be a serialized JSON string, consistent with the [ECMA 404](https://www.ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-404_2nd_edition_december_2017.pdf) definition of an object.\"",
